      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انهمز</span></b>  [quasi-pass. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَمَزَهُ</span>; <i>It was pressed,
squeezed,</i> or <i>pinched: he was pushed,</i> &amp;c. The
first of these significations is indicated, or implied, in the JK and the TA.] ― 
